10	/**
11	 * Dynamic per-game settings form. Renders the family schema (grouped fields, the
12	 * right widget per type) plus a variant/loader picker, and persists via
13	 * `saveGameConfig` — which validates, stores the values and enqueues a
14	 * GAME_CONFIG job to apply them.
